  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Home of The Saber Wallet. EDC (everyday carry) products geared toward outdoor adventure, work and survival. Titanium Pry Bars. Proudly made in the USA.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Lionwings&trade; was founded by maker and designer Brian Port to bring unique, premium quality gear and accessories to a world saturated by mass produced, cheaply made products.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Located in Westerville, OH (right outside Columbus, OH) Lionwings is a quickly growing small business.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">When you buy from Lionwings you are supporting small business and American jobs.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">With over 20 years of experience in industrial design and product development we seek to make highly functional, durable gear that exceeds expectations in craftsmenship. Every product we make is unique and handcrafted one at at time with superior quality.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Thank you to every one of our customers, we exist to serve and are grateful for your support.</span></p>",
